>> Animal := Obyek anyar.
>> Factory := Obyek anyar.

Animal nalika: ['anyar'] tindakna: {
	>> animal := dhiri anyar.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal nalika: ['sound:'] tindakna: { :s
	duweke sound := s.
}.

Animal nalika: ['sound'] tindakna: { <- duweke sound.
}.

>> Dog := Obyek anyar.
>> Cat := Obyek anyar.

Dog nalika: ['anyar'] tindakna: { <- Animal anyar sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat nalika: ['anyar'] tindakna: { <- Animal anyar sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Wetonan tulis: Dog anyar sound, baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: Cat anyar sound, baris-anyar.

Factory nalika: ['mix:and:'] tindakna: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal anyar sound: (
		( beast1 sound saka: 0 dawa: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound saka: 2 dawa: 5 )
	).
}.

Wetonan tulis: (Factory mix: Dog anyar and: Cat anyar) sound, baris-anyar.
